<Page title="Privacy Policy | MySpaFilter" description="MySpaFilter privacy policy: stored filter-reminder requests, hosting logs, cookies, and affiliate partners.">
<h1>Privacy policy</h1><p><em>Last updated: November 9, 2026</em></p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>You can use the cross-reference and the guides without an account and without giving us an email address. The size lookup, the part-number cross-reference lookup, and the date math on the replace-and-clean calculator run in your browser. Nothing you type into those three is sent to us. The contact form does not submit to our server: it opens your email app, addressed to <a href="mailto:contact@myspafilter.com">contact@myspafilter.com</a>, and nothing is sent until you send it from there. That address is the only one this site publishes.</p>
<h2>Stored requests</h2><p>Filter match pages, cartridge pages, the cross-reference lookup, and fitment pages include a form whose button says “Email me in 12 months to replace this exact filter.” The replace-and-clean calculator and the replacement schedule include a separate form, titled “Remind me when it’s time to replace my filter.” If you submit one, we store the request. None of these forms send email. They are not a newsletter, a weekly message, or a deals list.</p><p>What we store, and why:</p>
<ul>
<li>the email address you enter, so the request is tied to the address you gave</li>
<li>the page URL, so we know which page the request came from</li>
<li>the purpose: a 12-month replacement for one exact filter, or a filter replacement reminder with the interval you chose</li>
<li>for the 12-month form, the exact part: the OEM number, the matched Unicel, Pleatco, and Filbur numbers, the part id, and the month 12 months after you submit</li>
<li>for the interval form, the extra details you enter: filter model, install date, and replacement interval</li>
<li>the consent text shown on the form</li>
<li>the time the request was stored</li>
<li>a hash of the IP address, used only to limit repeated submissions. We do not store the address itself.</li>
</ul>
<p>When Google Analytics 4 is enabled, submitting the 12-month form also sends an event named reminder_signup with the part id. That event does not include the email address.</p>
<p>We'll only use your email for this request. The 12-month form uses the same limit, in the sentence under the email field. We do not sell, rent, or trade this information, and we do not share it with advertisers or data brokers.</p>
<p>To ask us to delete a stored request, email <a href="mailto:contact@myspafilter.com">contact@myspafilter.com</a> and include the address you submitted. Deletion requests are handled only at that address.</p>
<h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process standard request data, such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested, for security and performance. See Cloudflare's privacy policy. The reminder form also asks Cloudflare Turnstile to check that a person submitted it. That check runs only after you use the form.</p>
<h2>Affiliate partners and cookies</h2><p>This site sets no tracking cookies of its own. Clicking a retailer link (for example Amazon, FiltersFast, or Doheny's) takes you to that retailer's site, and the retailer or its affiliate network (such as Amazon Associates or Awin) may set cookies to attribute a purchase. Their own privacy policies cover those cookies. Which links are affiliate links, and the Associates tag they use, is explained in the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>This site is not directed to children under 13.</p>
<h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>We'll post any updates to this policy on this page. For questions, email <a href="mailto:contact@myspafilter.com">contact@myspafilter.com</a> or see <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>.</p>
</Page>
